WEBVTT

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.570
The road repair project really 
cleaned up this road.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:12.700
Yeah.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.390
Let's get together and do 
something after we eat.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:20.160
Oh, and we could go to the candy 
store after we play for a while.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.890
I want to play fairies!

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.220
Koma-chan, you can be a fairy, too.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:29.380
Uh, I'd rather be a human 
than a fairy, actually...

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.850
Oh, fine.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.510
Nattsun and I will be the fairies, then.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:38.350
Huh? I don't think I can be a fairy...

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:42.490
Just hold your hands out and 
lean forward like this,

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:45.310
say "va-voom," and run!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.040
Va-voom!

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.770
You're getting into it, Nattsun!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.030
I know. When the cherry blossoms 
bloom, let's go flower viewing.

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.980
Oh, that sounds great!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:29.040
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:29.040
<b>A Year Passed</b>

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:37.050
We're done cleaning, so shall we head back?

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.890
Rabbits

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.710
Okay!

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.890
See you later, rabbits.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:47.140
By the way, Nattsun asked me to get 
her ruler from her desk for her.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.930
Okay, we'll stop by the classroom 
after we return the key.

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:58.940
It's so nice out.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:03.620
What's wrong?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:05.420
That's...

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.510
That stick?

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:11.360
Yeah.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.000
What about it?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.660
It's the legendary sword.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.170
Sword? It looks like just a stick to me...

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:23.050
I brought it to school when 
I started first grade.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.420
Wow, really?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.510
That's right...

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:32.120
It's been a year already.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.690
Ren-chan, did you find her ruler?

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.140
I found it!

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:39.650
It's really smooth.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:43.360
Oh, Natsumi-senpai put more wax on it.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.100
Ready to go?

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.200
Hotarun, do you have time 
to play after this?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.620
Sure. What do you want to play?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.530
I want to go to the bamboo grove.

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.570
We can pick bamboo shoots.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.090
Really? I'd love to!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.070
I'm home.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.080
Welcome back.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.330
Welcome back.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.220
Did you get the rabbits taken care of?

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.300
Yeah.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:29.360
Hey, can we go pick bamboo 
shoots on our mountain later?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.400
Hotarun said she'd go with me.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.590
Bamboo shoots?

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:35.870
Oh, yeah, I guess it's that 
time of year already.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.280
Maybe I'll go with you, then.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.590
It's been ages since I picked bamboo shoots.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.420
Come with us, too, Hika-nee.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:44.670
Picking bamboo shoots, huh?

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.050
I think I've had hay fever lately, though...

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:51.530
Well, she did just come home 
today on the night bus.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.540
Let's let her rest.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.270
I'll invite everyone else!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.160
Good idea. They all like bamboo shoots.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:59.160
I'm not <i>that</i> tired, really...

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.900
Oh, I know.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:04.030
Let's eat them as sashimi 
after we pick them.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.240
It'll be tasty.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.360
I want sashimi!

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:09.990
Also, we'll need shovels 
to pick bamboo shoots!

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.360
You're getting all hyped up for no reason.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.820
I think the shovels are in the shed outside.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.390
We'll need a hoe, too.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.920
I mean, sashimi is good, but...

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.000
Okay, let's go get them!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.300
I'll invite Candy Store 
and everyone else, too!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.920
Are you guys even listening to me?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:21.180
Okay. Let's call everyone later.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:22.890
Hey...

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.180
I never said I wouldn't go...

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:43.500
I never said I wouldn't go!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.320
Oh, you're coming, too?

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.320
Sure, come with us.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.490
Oh, there's Ren-chon and her sisters.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.520
Everyone's here already!

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.960
Sorry we're a little late.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.730
Ready to go?

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:00.940
Yeah!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.050
A dog!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.520
Oh, is this the first time 
you've seen him, Ren-chan?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.570
This is my family's dog.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:14.420
He wanted to go for a walk, 
so I brought him along.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.020
He's cute.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:24.780
Come here, Knee-Knocker! Knee-Knocker!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.980
Uh, Ren-chan, his name is Pechi...

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.250
Hey, I see some bamboo shoots!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.670
There are lots of them!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:46.160
Call me after you dig up the 
dirt around the shoots.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.780
I'll cut them with the hoe.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:48.880
Okay!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:51.720
Bamboo shoots...

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:54.740
Hey, Renge.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.680
What?

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:58.620
Be careful digging up these bamboo shoots.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:02.650
Princess Kaguya might be inside one of them.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.230
What?! P-Princess Kaguya?!

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:09.080
I've heard rumors about that, too!

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.970
They say a person lives inside the bamboo!

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.820
Huh? Uh, yeah...

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.200
I thought it was just a rumor.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.960
So it's true!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:23.830
I'd feel bad if I broke 
her bamboo shoot house.

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:27.420
I can't pick bamboo shoots now. 
What should I do?

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:31.050
<i>I was just joking, 
and she took it seriously...</i>

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.640
<i>It's hard to tell her it's not true 
after I was the one who said it.</i>

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.850
U-Um, but still...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.690
It's not like she's living 
inside all of them...

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.340
But what if she is inside one?

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:45.430
Wouldn't you feel bad, Koma-chan?

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:48.030
W-Well, of course, but...

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.990
Hey, I know. Why don't you just 
check to see if she's inside them?

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.300
Th-That's it! I'll do that!

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.740
Yeah. So let's pick some bamboo shoots.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.760
This bamboo shoot is...

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.260
Safe!

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:17.720
Okay, Koma-chan! You check one, too!

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:19.560
Huh?

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.750
Hotarun, any bamboo shoots over here?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.560
There are lots of them here!

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:28.420
All right, Hika-nee, let's have a 
contest to see who can get the most.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.940
Okay, let's do it!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.980
You won't beat me, Hika-nee!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.860
Hey, now, you're a few years 
too early to beat me!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.250
Whoa! Pechi digs really fast!

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.610
Pechi...

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.430
Hika-nee, we can't let Pechi beat us!

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.710
Okay! Leave it to me!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.820
Pechi!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.000
Hey! Pechi's actually eating it!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.260
Hika-nee, we can't let him win!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.720
You want to eat them?! Just let him win!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.020
I think we've dug around that one enough.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.390
Let's get Nee-chan over here with the hoe.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.940
Was Kazu-nee over here?

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.460
Yeah, I think so.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.740
Anyone in there?

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.570
Anyone in there?

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.900
Anyone in there?

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.950
Anyone in there?

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.560
<i>What are they doing?</i>

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.560
<i>What are they doing?</i>

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.590
I got a big one!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.480
The ones with yellow tips 
are best for sashimi.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.470
They taste less astringent.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.680
Then let's eat mine!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.600
Yeah, it looks good.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.670
We can have lunch at our place.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.140
Let's eat!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:01.460
It's so sweet and soft! It's delicious!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.080
Tastes like spring!

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:05.520
I put on too much wasabi!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.900
You should exhale through 
your nose when that happens.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.250
Senpai, this stew is great.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:12.460
I made it a little salty.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.860
I want to go to the secret base tomorrow.

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:18.260
Sure. It has been a long time.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.090
I have something to do there.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.110
I'll put it here.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.440
Oh, sealing it up, huh?

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.540
Hey, what do you want to play?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.370
A nap.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.040
That's not playing.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.050
A snooze.

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.250
That's the same thing!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.000
Why don't we go sunbathing, then?

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.780
It feels so nice and warm.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.170
I'm photosynthesizing.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.330
Why do they call it sun "bathing," though?

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:10.810
I'm not sure. Maybe it was a dialect?

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:31.690
Oh, some cherry blossoms are blooming!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.210
They're a little early this year.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.280
Oh, yeah!

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:39.510
You and I promised to go flower viewing when 
the cherry blossoms bloomed, didn't we?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.170
Yeah!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.630
I'll make lunches for us.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:46.180
Oh, that's okay. I'll make them.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.660
Oh, um... But I'm worried 
you might hurt yourself...

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:54.660
And I'd feel kinda bad 
having you make mine...

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:56.190
I don't mind.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:58.180
Want to make them together 
at my house, then?

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.490
Sure! Let's do that!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.930
Okay! We'll go flower viewing tomorrow!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.490
We're here!

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:08.810
Welcome.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:11.300
The rice with bamboo shoots 
will be ready soon.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:12.690
Mom will pack it for us.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.960
Oh! Thank you!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.420
What are these?

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.110
Sakura mochi.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:20.010
I just haven't wrapped the 
leaves around them yet.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.880
Would you girls help me finish them?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.460
I will!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.760
How do we do it?

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.720
I have some desalinated cherry 
blossom leaves there.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:29.240
Just wrap them around the mochi.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:30.480
Got it.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.330
Is this okay?

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.730
Yes, that's perfect.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.090
I'll do it, too!

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:37.360
I'll eat one!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.630
Eat them later.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:42.280
It's kind of boring with 
just cherry blossom leaves.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.200
What if we used nori or something?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.160
U-Um, they're not rice balls...

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.220
Then how about konbu? 
There's kobumaki, too!

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:51.410
I think these are too sweet.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:54.290
Then how about cheese? 
That'd be trendy, right?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.860
Um... Um...

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.130
Hello?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.560
Someone's here.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:01.020
Mom, there's a visitor.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.140
Coming!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.120
I haven't seasoned the stew in the 
pot yet, so hold off on that.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.720
Here's the neighborhood bulletin, 
and some bracken from our back yard.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.600
Oh, thank you!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:14.700
They're done!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.980
Yep, they are.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.050
They're still talking?

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.900
Looks like they'll be a while.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.020
Want to wait out there?

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.820
I wonder if it's far...

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:23.990
It is.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.570
It's so nice out today.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:32.180
Great weather for sunbathing.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:40.850
Just sitting around is boring 
when it's so warm outside.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.370
What? I think this is nice.

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.260
I'm with Ren-chon.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.970
But we can't play until 
your mom is done talking.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.370
I know, but...

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.500
Okay, talk about something fun, then.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.960
You do it, Natsumi.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:01.410
Okay, I'll tell you about 
the dream I had last night.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:04.080
There was this huge monster in it.

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:07.600
It was so huge, you could only see its feet.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:11.660
Like, from its knees up, it shot 
right through the atmosphere.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.470
Even shooting missiles at 
it didn't take it down,

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:17.070
so people said, "an eye for 
an eye, a foot for a foot,"

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:21.070
and everyone in the world decided to 
beat it by kicking it in the knees.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.840
Do you think this could make a fun story?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.050
Sorry. I wasn't listening.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.180
Hey!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.740
What, really?

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:32.080
Really!

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:38.100
Mom and the neighbor lady are still talking.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:41.370
We can't go flower viewing if 
our lunches aren't finished.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.290
Then let's play slapsies.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.920
Oh, we played that at my old school, too!

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.580
Yeah, let's play!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:48.840
Huh?

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.170
Okay, I'm on bottom.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:54.340
Ah, I took too long... 
Don't slap too hard, okay?

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.540
I know, I know.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.040
Nee-chan, that was just a feint.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.760
You won't fool me next time.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:09.630
Ow! You hit way too hard!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:12.910
Oh, come on. It's your turn next.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.290
Okay!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.050
Ha!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:22.370
Ow! Darn it! Why'd you all 
pull your hands back?!

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.090
That's the point of the game.

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.820
I'm done with this. I'm gonna get some tea.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.640
Get me some, too.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.290
What? Get your own tea.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.910
What's the difference between bringing 
one and bringing enough for everyone?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.580
I'll help you.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.330
Oh, fine. Let's go, Hotaru.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.340
Okay.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.000
What now, Nattsun? Want to play again?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.590
It's not as fun with just two people.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.760
Hey, a butterfly! Butterfly!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.600
Wait, butterfly!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.290
Nattsun, come on!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.790
Coming!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:03.580
It went that way!

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:06.610
Man, this is gonna be 
too hard without a net.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.240
Where'd it go?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.650
It went where I can't reach it.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.370
Hup! Aww, see? It got away.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:18.740
Nattsun, the butterfly got away, 
so let's go check on Hikarimono Boss.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.480
The carp? Wanna go see it?

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.690
Yeah!

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:43.990
Huh?

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:45.740
They're both gone.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:50.380
Jeez, she makes us bring tea 
and then just disappears...

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.840
I wonder where they went.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.310
Should we try calling them?

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.770
Natsumi! Renge!

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.940
We brought your drinks!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.170
If it's tea, I'll drink it later.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:03.430
It's juice.

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.170
Juice! Juice!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.170
Juice!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.280
You came back fast.

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:08.220
Where were you guys?

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:09.690
Thanks so much!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.760
Sorry to keep you so long.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.270
Sounds like they're finally done.

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:16.030
Let's go flower viewing!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.900
You done talking, Mom?

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.840
Yes, I'm done. Sorry you had to wait.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.440
Is the stew done?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.020
It is. Give me a minute and I'll pack it up.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:30.230
There you go.

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.120
Be careful.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.040
The others will come join you later.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.570
Okay!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.790
Hotarun!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.570
This is for you.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:43.500
What's this?

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.760
Shepherd's purse. It makes 
noise when you shake it.

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:48.460
Wow, it does!

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.340
Thanks, Ren-chan!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.850
Oh, here comes the bus.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.600
This should be a good spot.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.300
Here's some tea.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:49.690
Oh, thanks.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.610
Let's eat the sakura mochi.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.270
We should eat lunch first.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.030
Is that a rule?

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.150
Sweet things are for dessert.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.630
Hey, there you are!

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:03.370
We made sandwiches.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:07.410
I made norimaki, yakisoba, 
and rolled omelets.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.250
I brought stuff, too.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.280
All right!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.230
We suddenly have lots more food!

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:13.840
Party! Party!

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:17.710
Hey, before we eat, why don't 
we all take a picture?

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.050
Oh, good idea.

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:21.640
Here we go!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.060
Okay!

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.400
All right, smile.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.250
Okay, got it!

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.130
I'll take one, too.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:38.370
Okay, let's eat.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.000
Dig in!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:42.210
I'm digging in, too!

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:43.850
Go for it.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:46.060
Guys, look this way! Hey!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.520
I'll eat, too.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:49.950
Hikage, why don't you take 
one of everyone eating?

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.700
Hika-nee, let me take one later, too.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:53.680
Okay.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.920
Hotaru, something wrong?

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:03.380
This turned out to be a really 
lively flower viewing, huh?

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:06.760
Yeah.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:57.060
Hotarun, aren't the bamboo shoots yummy?

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:59.570
Yeah, they're delicious!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:04.700
We should all go pick edible plants and 
bamboo shoots together next year, too.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:05.820
Yeah!

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.780
And then we'll come here to 
look at the flowers again!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.130
Yeah!
